  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"876\" height=\"285\"></p><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Overview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"789\" height=\"127\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">高级外设(Advanced Peripherals)是一个为CC:Tweaked(Computercraft)添加了许多实用扩展的模组。<br>该模组旨在添加如PeripheralsPlusOne或Plethora等模组在旧版Minecraft中提供的功能。<br>借助高级外设，你可以仅通过聊天消息控制你的Minecraft基地，<br>通过我们的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.advanced-peripherals.de%252fintegrations%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">模组集成</a>实现梦想中的模组控制，<br>或随心所欲地改造世界！</span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">使用CC:Tweaked(Computercraft)和高级外设，你的创造将不受任何限制。<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span><span>如果你想支持我，可以通过<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/srendi\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>进行。但任何形式的支持都是对我的鼓励！</span></span> </span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Community.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"122\"><br>如果需要帮助，请加入<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.intelligence-modding.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>社区。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你有建议或发现问题，请在<a href=\"https://github.com/Seniorendi/AdvancedPeripherals\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>上告诉我们！<br><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Information.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"119\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>新增内容</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">高级外设是一个功能丰富的模组。<br>请查看我们的文档以获取完整列表。<br><br>完整文档：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.intelligence-modding.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.intelligence-modding.de</a><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Breaker.png\" width=\"1851\" height=\"98\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>计划功能</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">计划功能列表非常庞大。你可以在此处查看部分（非全部）功能：<a href=\"https://github.com/Seniorendi/AdvancedPeripherals/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果你有建议，也可以在此提出。<br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Breaker.png\" width=\"1851\" height=\"98\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>视频</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">欢迎制作关于此模组的视频。<br></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>来自toastonrye的教程<br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vegXpliPFhA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><br>0.7r版本更新日志</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tIpBTgSkWr0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Breaker.png\" width=\"1851\" height=\"98\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>示例</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我们提供了大量功能示例及简单脚本。查看文档即可了解它们<br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">文档</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我们为你准备了完整的手写文档！请点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.intelligence-modding.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>访问！<br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Advanced_Peripherals/BH_AP_Breaker.png\" width=\"1851\" height=\"98\"><br></span></span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmyftb.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://intelligence-modding.de/images/MyFTB_Full.png\" alt=\"MyFTB\" width=\"980\" height=\"392\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">你在寻找充满挑战的新冒险吗？<br>梦想着机器、发电厂、魔法甚至蜜蜂？<br>MyFTB是德国最大的模组Minecraft服务器网络。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">一个世界不够！因此我们为每位玩家提供独立世界。<br>无论是单人还是组队游玩，都能获得最大的灵活性和安全性，尽享游戏乐趣。<br>超过20个模组包，总有一款适合你！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>访问他们的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmyftb.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">网站</a>、<a href=\"https://discord.gg/myftb\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>和<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flauncher.myftb.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">启动器</a><br>通过MyFTB启动器，你始终能获得在服务器上玩耍所需的正确模组包版本。此外，服务器已直接保存！<br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">使用许可：</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你可以随意在任何模组包中使用本模组。</span></p>",
